Package: nl.retrotok.legacytiktok
Name: LegacyTikTok
Version: 0.7.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Standalone TikTok viewer for iOS 6 (armv7). Talks to TikTok directly with its own TLS (mbedTLS); no server or computer needed.
Maintainer: milan-wamelink
Author: milan-wamelink
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
